# No Cursor attribution

Never add Cursor branding or agent attribution anywhere in git or GitHub output.

Forbidden (including variants / markdown links):
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `Made with Cursor` / `Made-with: Cursor`
- `git commit --trailer` (or any equivalent) that attributes work to Cursor/cursoragent
- Cursor attribution footers in PR bodies or commit messages

If the environment injects these automatically, strip them before finishing (amend the HEAD commit you just created when safe, or update the PR body). Do not ask the user to clean them up.
